// expect-lint: 80:25 `x` holds a `File` that is never closed - bind it with `using` or call `close()`; the GC does not close it
// expect-lint: 88:10 `g` holds a `File` that is never closed - bind it with `using` or call `close()`; the GC does not close it
// expect-lint: 94:25 `x` holds a `File` that is never closed - bind it with `using` or call `close()`; the GC does not close it
// expect-lint: 101:25 `v` holds a `File` that is never closed - bind it with `using` or call `close()`; the GC does not close it
